  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_73e18036-5546-4f2d-9813-640cafe26d03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"839\" height=\"352\"></p><h1 style=\"line-height:40.6px;text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_f22a3936-1f7b-4eab-ab9a-a1d370b4d9d0.png\" width=\"886\" height=\"245\"></strong></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HXsBBYbQsE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_d731138a-ff4e-47b6-bef7-58da20c73038.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"139\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/MiauczelsMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px;float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_063588f7-27ee-47a1-9610-4709540c5958.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"130\"></a></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\">YouTube 搶先看：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@miaucze7991\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@miaucze7991</a></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">傳奇怪物（Legendary Monsters）是一個旨在增加具有獨特背景故事的困難 Boss，以及散布在世界各地的較小 Boss 級生物的模組<br><br><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944035/description_47ac74a5-0d7d-4749-b624-d5b238fab9c7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"263\"></p>\n<p>以及我們去過的群系</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>與群系、戰鬥機制模組的相容性：</p>\n<p>正在尋找與 Epic Fight 的相容性嗎？試試這個為 Epic Fight 增加相容性的驚人模組！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-legendary-monsters-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-legendary-monsters-epicfight</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>感謝：</p><p>Bf_Meow 創作了精美的紋理。</p><p>StarJumpXY2334 創作了精美的動態精靈圖。</p><p>L_Enders_Cataclysm 分享了原始碼，我使用了部分渲染內容、複雜數學計算和一個動畫系統，並在 Java 上學到了很多</p><p>感謝「湮滅」贊助者：</p><p>| Voidra | Anthony | Lib | Water333111000| 510 pentagon | Crimson7Cookie | FLOOPY R.G | lilp382 |</p>",
